 (mirror the\n`expert-coder` entry); and (b) an invariant test wrapping `skills-master/project-manager/bin`\npm-regressions (3/3) + a bin hash match, asserting `decompose.mjs` is the 113-line\nhardened version. The new `map.json` entry is the in-repo deliverable the invariant\nsuite exercises. Accept: `pytest -v` GREEN (pm-regressions exit 0; drift stays GREEN).\nFINALIZE (manual, cross-repo, outward): reconcile the 9 divergent SKILL.md bodies;\nretire/untrack the kit from Agentic-Home; push canonical -> published repo (never a\nForeman auto-push).\n","numLines":62,"startLine":1,"totalLines":62}}}
